  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme Development Fund 2015</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programutvecklingsfond</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xf6;vergripande syftet med fonden &#xe4;r att ha en flexibel              finansieringsmekanismen f&#xf6;r sm&#xe5; och korta sikt bidrag bed&#xf6;ms          n&#xf6;dv&#xe4;ndig f&#xf6;r att uppn&#xe5; m&#xe5;len f&#xf6;r st&#xe5;ndpunkten f&#xf6;r Sveriges           utvecklingssamarbete i Zimbabwe. Verksamhet som finansieras &#xe4;r f&#xf6;re   revisioner, oplanerade revisioner och s&#xe4;rskilda konsulter, en av      evenemang som World Aids Day.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the fund is to have a flexible funding       mechanism for small and short term contributions deemed necessary for achieving the goals for the Position Paper for Sweden&apos;s development   cooperation in Zimbabwe. Activities funded include pre-audits,        unplanned audits, and special consultancies, one off events such as   the World Aids Day.</narrative>
  </description>
